From: AndroidEmu contributors
Subject: [PATCH] configure: do not execute target binaries during cross builds

Darwin arm64 and iOS arm64 share Meson's system/CPU identity, but iOS
executables cannot run on the macOS build host. Require an executable
wrapper explicitly; no wrapper is supplied for device-only builds.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1843,6 +1843,9 @@
 
   echo "# Automatically generated by configure - do not modify" > $cross
   echo "[properties]" >> $cross
+  if test "$cross_compile" = "yes"; then
+    echo "needs_exe_wrapper = true" >> $cross
+  fi
 
   # unroll any custom device configs
   for a in $device_archs; do
